1
00:00:00,235 --> 00:00:04,545
(Leonard:)But we were thinking more of us
maybe living together with...

2
00:00:05,507 --> 00:00:06,507
(Leonard:)...not you.

3
00:00:09,578 --> 00:00:11,358
(Sheldon:)I don't understand.

4
00:00:12,914 --> 00:00:15,754
(Sheldon:)How could we all live together
if I'm not there?

5
00:00:17,753 --> 00:00:19,863
Look, I know this is...
this is change,

6
00:00:20,022 --> 00:00:22,592
(Leonard:)-and that sounds scary--
-Where are you going to go?

7
00:00:22,758 --> 00:00:24,428
(Sheldon:)I don't know.

8
00:00:24,593 --> 00:00:26,593
(Leonard:)We just started to think about this.

9
00:00:26,762 --> 00:00:28,032
(Leonard:)Maybe I'll move in with Penny,

10
00:00:28,196 --> 00:00:31,036
(Leonard:)or maybe she and I'll take this
place, you can move across the hall.

11
00:00:31,199 --> 00:00:33,199
(Sheldon:)Move across the hall?

12
00:00:34,102 --> 00:00:36,672
(Sheldon:)Did you take a marijuana?

13
00:00:39,608 --> 00:00:41,108
(Penny(on phone):)No, I did not.

14
00:00:41,276 --> 00:00:43,776
(Sheldon:)Did you get hit on the head
with a coconut?

15
00:00:44,946 --> 00:00:46,946
(Howard:)-No.
-Well, then, I'm all out of guesses.

16
00:00:47,115 --> 00:00:50,565
(Sheldon:)What? Me move across the hall-- Why
would you even suggest such a thing?

17
00:00:50,719 --> 00:00:54,359
(Leonard:)Because I love Penny, and want
to give her the life she deserves.

18
00:00:54,956 --> 00:00:56,226
(Sheldon:)I see.

19
00:00:56,391 --> 00:01:02,021
(Sheldon:)You're putting your future
bride's happiness above mine.

